  "task": {
    "objective": "Each two-role crew competes for a majority of three movable salvage crates while using shared tidal locks.",
    "natural_termination": "A crew deposits at least two of the three crates, otherwise horizon ninety-six. At joint end the higher score wins; equal scores draw. Natural completion takes priority at the horizon.",
    "interaction": "Only riggers operate counterweights and only haulers lift crates. A loaded move entering or leaving a lock requires a simultaneous rigger of the same crew. Unladen opposing entrants can use and consume shared entry tickets, and rival riggers can contest the same console-controlled lock. Loaded motion imposes recovery time.",
